Z||000008||mbramble||10-24-2000||09:10 PM||||What you can't see on the coupe fascia is the bad tear on the passenger's side and the fact that all the mounting tabs along the hood hood area were broken out.  It was barely hanging on.<P>I would like to get the ground f/x and an aereo rear fasica but I have spent enough money for awhile.<P>My son and I are taking a 1200+ mile trip in it this weekend to a baseball tourney he is playing in S. FL.  ||||reg||1
